      "writtenOn": "2014-09-04T20:23:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This onReceive() will be called only when there is a out going call happens. After we parse out the dialing number, this variable is getting rest. \n\nEmergency callback mode will be checked by line 267:\nBoolean.parseBoolean(SystemProperties.get(TelephonyProperties.PROPERTY_INECM_MODE));",
