        "id": 1049138
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-09-04T20:23:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It should be false and is corrected in the next patch.\n\nThe checker decides which function it is going to call.\nIf mIsSuplEsEnabled is false, handleNi() will be called for legacy behavior and acceptance behavior. If mIsSuplEsEnabled is true, handleNiInEs() will be call to see if we should deny some cases.",
      "parentUuid": "d07987b6_23c454da",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 207,
        "startChar": 32,
        "endLine": 207,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "ea09e12a0649a29fbad83a7fa7c95fe05d584823",
